# build.minimal — the dead-code root set for `cargo xtask build-wasi --minimal`.
# One export name per line; everything unreachable from these is dropped by
# wasm-ld (STEP, XCAF, glTF, STL, HLR projection, curve authoring). The full
# profile (no --minimal) exports everything and ships in crate/src/; this
# minimal blob installs to dist/occt-wasm-minimal.wasm.br for deployment.
# A listed name that doesn't exist in the facade is a build error (typo guard).

